       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TOTIENT-SCULPT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TOTIENT-SCULPT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-MASS-MAP-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SCULPT-HOMOMORPH-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MASS-CONSERVATION-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPHEROID-DISP-PROJ-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-SCULPT-SEAL-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TOTIENT-SCULPT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-SCULPT-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-SCULPT-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MASS-AND-HOMOMORPHISM.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CONSERVATION-AND-PROJECTION.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-SCULPT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MASS-AND-HOMOMORPHISM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-MASS-MAP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SCULPT-HOMOMORPH-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CONSERVATION-AND-PROJECTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MASS-CONSERVATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPHEROID-DISP-PROJ-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-SCULPT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-TOTIENT-MASS-MAP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SCULPT-HOMOMORPH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MASS-CONSERVATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPHEROID-DISP-PROJ-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-SCULPT-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-SCULPT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-SCULPT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-SCULPT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-SCULPT-CODE.
